RISCV MP
"Message passing with two plain stores. Store->store reordering. Forbidden under TSO, allowed under RVWMO."
{ 0:x10=x; 0:x12=y; 1:x10=y; 1:x12=x; }
 P0              | P1              ;
 ori x11,x0,1   | lw x11,0(x10)   ;
 sw x11,0(x10)  | lw x13,0(x12)   ;
 ori x13,x0,1   |                 ;
 sw x13,0(x12)  |                 ;
exists (1:x11=1 /\ 1:x13=0)
